// OTA ECU -- board layer, STM32H743 target.
//
// The same carrier as every other ECU in this project. It exists as a file of
// its own because a board key is an ECU role, and this is the role that writes
// its own flash while running.
//
// Nothing is added here. The flash controller this node depends on --
// MTD.STM32H7_FlashController at 0x52002000, wired to flashBank1 and
// flashBank2 -- comes from the stock STM32H743 description the platform below
// inherits. It is Renode's model, not ours; scripts/check-flash-model.sh pins
// the behaviour we rely on so that an emulator upgrade which changed it is
// caught rather than silently changing every OTA verdict.
using "../nucleo_h743zi_can.repl"
